<title>POLAND: OKOCIM Q4 NET JUMPS TO PLN 5.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>OKOCIM Q4 NET JUMPS TO PLN 5.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Okocim SA results for the fourth</p>
